Probability\":true,\"depth\":9,\"selectiveLogic\":0,\"group\":\"\",\"group_override\":false,\"group_weight\":100,\"prevent_recursion\":false,\"delay_until_recursion\":false,\"scan_depth\":null,\"match_whole_words\":null,\"use_group_scoring\":false,\"case_sensitive\":null,\"automation_id\":\"\",\"role\":0,\"vectorized\":false,\"sticky\":0,\"cooldown\":0,\"delay\":0,\"match_persona_description\":false,\"match_character_description\":false,\"match_character_personality\":false,\"match_character_depth_prompt\":false,\"match_scenario\":false,\"match_creator_notes\":false}},{\"id\":11,\"keys\":[\"喂奶\",\"母乳\",\"奶水\"],\"secondary_keys\":[],\"comment\":\"母乳制品\",\"content\":\"母乳制品:\\n  定义: 以母乳替代牛奶制成的食品\\n  要求:\\n    - 母亲恢复泌乳能力:\\n        触发条件: 与儿子发生性行为\\n        效果: 乳房再次开始分泌乳汁\\n    - 预防乳房胀痛:\\n        原因: 母乳分泌过多\\n        解决方法:\\n          - 儿子直接吸吮并饮用乳汁\\n          - 母亲使用吸奶器收集多余乳汁\\n  应用:\\n    - 直接食用:\\n        形式: 生鲜母乳\\n        消费者: 儿子\\n    - 制作乳制品:\\n        形式:\\n          - 酸奶\\n          - 奶酪\\n          - 冰淇淋\\n          - 奶油\\n        消费者: 儿子\",\"constant\":true,\"selective\":true,\"insertion_order\":100,\"enabled\":true,\"position\":\"after_char\",\"use_regex\":true,\"extensions\":{\"position\":4,\"exclude_recursion\":false,\"display_index\":11,\"probability\":100,\"useProbability\":true,\"depth\":8,\"selectiveLogic\":0,\"group\":\"\",\"group_override\":false,\"group_weight\":100,\"prevent_recursion\":false,\"delay_until_recursion\":false,\"scan_depth\":null,\"match_whole_words\":null,\"use_group_scoring\":false,\"case_sensitive\":null,\"automation_id\":\"\",\"role\":0,\"vectorized\":false,\"sticky\":0,\"cooldown\":0,\"delay\":0,\"match_persona_description\":false,\"match_character_description\":false,\"match_character_personality\":false,\"match_character_depth_prompt\":false,\"match_scenario\":false,\"match_creator_notes\":false}},{\"id\":12,\"keys\":[\"长林村\"],\"secondary_keys\":[],\"comment\":\"长林村\",\"content\":\"名称: 长林村\\n\\n地理环境:\\n  - 山水格局: 背靠连绵青山，清澈的河流穿村而过